    <string name="ayudaUsoTitulo">1. How do I use the app?</string>
    <string name="ayudaUsoTexto">
        -Choose the converter you want (Inches, Metres or Yards).\n
        -Enter a value in the text box.\n
        -Tap "Convert" to get the result.\n
        -Tap "Swap" to change the direction of the conversion.
    </string>
    <string name="ayudaErroresTitulo">Error Messages and Exceptions</string>
    <string name="ayudaErroresTexto">
        -NoValueException: happens if you tap "Convert" while the text field is empty.\n\n
        -NumberTooSmallException: happens if you enter a number lower than 1, since only values from 1 upwards are allowed.
    </string>
